\import \root.GeneralLinear[K := R.Real, field := R.Algebra[].field, conjugation := linear_algebra.Hermitian[].Real[].scalar, scalar := vector_bundles.Bundles[].Real[].scalar, n := r] \as GL;
\definition Fiber[x: M.Point]: \Set := GL.Frames[V := F x, space := space x].Frame;
\structure Point: \Set := { base: M.Point, frame: Fiber base };
\definition projection[p: Point]: M.Point := p.base;
\definition act[p: Point][g: GL.Carrier]: Point := Point { base := p.base, frame := GL.Frames[V := F p.base, space := space p.base].act p.frame g };
\definition actionIdentity: \forall (p: Point) -> act p GL.identity = p :=
  \induction (p: Point) \return act p GL.identity = p \with {
    | # : \fun (x: M.Point)(f: Fiber x) => congr!{{Fiber x} Point} (Point::# x) _ _ (GL.Frames[V := F x, space := space x].actIdentity f)
  };
\definition actionProduct: \forall (p: Point)(g, h: GL.Carrier) -> act (act p g) h = act p (GL.multiply g h) :=
  \fun (p: Point)(g, h: GL.Carrier) => congr!{{Fiber p.base} Point} (Point::# p.base) _ _ (GL.Frames[V := F p.base, space := space p.base].actProduct p.frame g h);
\module Local(i: I);
\module Change(i, j: I);

\definition free: \forall (x: M.Point)(f: Fiber x)(g, h: GL.Carrier) -> GL.Frames[V := F x, space := space x].act f g = GL.Frames[V := F x, space := space x].act f h -> g = h :=
  \fun (x: M.Point) => GL.Frames[V := F x, space := space x].free;
\definition transitive: \forall (x: M.Point)(f, g: Fiber x) -> GL.Frames[V := F x, space := space x].act f (GL.Frames[V := F x, space := space x].change g f) = g :=
  \fun (x: M.Point) => GL.Frames[V := F x, space := space x].transitive;
\module Smooth(enumeration: Operations.PairIndices[n := r, m := r].Enumeration);
